## User Review Required

> [!IMPORTANT]
> **No Host Dependencies**: Since we are using **Docker**, you do NOT need to install `npm` or `python` on the VM itself. Docker will build everything inside the containers.

> [!TIP]
> **Subdomain Config**: By using `sqauto.zeraynce.com`, we can serve both the Frontend and the Backend from the same domain (Backend on `/api`). This avoids many CORS issues.

